factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says the DMK-era practice was that Kerala irrigation officials 'வழக்கமாக வைத்திருந்தனர்' and releases water after 40 ft, but the article says the DMK period did not store up to that level and that Kerala officials made releasing water through the sluice gate after 40 ft a routine practice; the draft states the release practice as past fact without the article's framing that the DMK government did not store to 45 ft.
  The reel_script omits the article's key point that the DMK government did not store water up to 45 ft, which is the reason the article gives for the current expectation of raising storage to 45 ft.
  The reel_script states 'தி மு க ஆட்சிக் காலத்தில் 40 அடிக்குப் பின்' and the caption/script describe the 45 ft storage as a routine safety level; the article says 45 ft is the usual safety storage level, which the draft matches, but the slide 'அணை பாதுகாப்பு' line 'நீர்க்கசிவு சரி செய்ய மாநகராட்சி மதிப்பீடு தயார்' drops that the estimate was prepared together with the Kerala irrigation department, mixing it with the statement about Kerala officials' good relations.
  The reel_script says 'மாநகராட்சி அதிகாரிகள் நீர்ப்பாசனத் துறையினருடன் பேசி' without specifying Kerala irrigation department, which is the party the article names; the caption correctly names Kerala, so the script and caption disagree on the counterpart.
